d but absent from the actual selected ZIP. Thus the required governance snapshot is incomplete despite actual command exit0 and capture_integrity_ok=true.\",\n+      \"missing_exact_paths\": [\n+        {\n+          \"path\": \"AGENTS.md\",\n+          \"raw_sha256\": \"6635867d8d12521d553d503e3c461b30d995f56db06f5acc3eb1745ec8688a93\",\n+          \"bytes\": 10449\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"path\": \"CONTRIBUTING.md\",\n+          \"raw_sha256\": \"ea004f626be82fde7e4b5c42dacd112cdba47574333c4b8af1fd2593d45bd11f\",\n+          \"bytes\": 6516\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"path\": \"README.md\",\n+          \"raw_sha256\": \"d87cb0cfb1527659a7948d6adad488ff45061388b9f2d68dc3a0da865b73fa9b\",\n+          \"bytes\": 38655\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"path\": \"docs/contracts/online-book-v1/coverage.json\",\n+          \"raw_sha256\": \"c41f8beecc5265ac31156016c2825adcb793f6d24a09050bd004bb0f499f1651\",\n+          \"bytes\": 12505\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"path\": \"docs/contribution-contract.schema.json\",\n+          \"raw_sha256\": \"ca2537b18ca59a59d341b1f8c71b3969af4864ab6e06abce8781eb9f2f86ff99\",\n+          \"bytes\": 8717\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"path\": \"docs/contributor-codex-contract.md\",\n+          \"raw_sha256\": \"bf1bea6a7532f1a192f6289107e3120a6428b2806850cfe69bb62c71865a8353\",\n+          \"bytes\": 7546\n+        },\n+        {\n+          \"path\": \"docs/theorem-publication-protocol.md\",\n+          \"raw_sha256\": \"71772f56444ba1e919aab9cc0d8caab3f0fb6b20887a12aa0f73001afd1c4385\",\n+          \"bytes\": 6069\n+        }\n+      ],\n+      \"minimal_repair\": \"Preserve original recorder/capture/seal. Add exactly these seven paths to successor selected_for_zip exact set; independently review it and an explicit immutable-original-seal/addendum checker. Commit the append-only preparation, then capture a fresh clean actual context and independently verify the complete RAW/ZIP set.\"\n+