-identity-20261011%2Findependent-precanary-v2%2Ffresh-independent-precanary-review-v2.md?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@\n+Accepted-precanary-context; no blockers.\n+\n+Independent current re-enumeration equals pre/post RAW and actual selected ZIP: all1319 paths, hashes and sizes match. All twelve enumerated governance inputs, including the formerly omitted seven, are present. Actual checkerV4 under recorderV2 returned0 with intact capture evidence at clean cb4fe8ec8b979a698c31d3ebf5a350ac7242a66a.\n+\n+The original317-input seal is unchanged; the addendum supplies57 inputs. The entire376-file own set, including both self-files, equals committed Git blobs. The last commit adds exactly those57 files plus the addendum. Core and both complete headers/type-elaboration evidence are unchanged; Test is absent and Mathlib remains clean at its pin. Prior rejected capture, helper repairs and CRLF diagnostics are preserved.\n+\n+This certifies pre-canary context only. Parent must separately authorize Test BODY. The future first conjunct in each theorem must actually consume the production specialization. No proof/fullgate execution, whole B4, chapter or Goal acceptance is claimed. Requested Astra/medium; runtime not independently attested."},{"sha":"be88635d24131b599193b1978a4134714a7d6b1c","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-preproof/.gitattributes","status":"added","additions":3,"deletions":0,"changes":3,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-preproof%2F.gitattributes","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Findependent-preproof%2F.gitattributes","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b