s, and draft-author versus stabilizing-parent exposure is distinguished. Pure contract validation reports no errors. The original rejected snapshot and review remain preserved.\n+\n+All87 exact ports,116/317/57 frozen inputs, unchanged core/Test, one import per shared root, precise three reader appends, preserved old objects and five protected manifest paths were verified. Two actual same-core Test consumers are named. Source topology and actual VALUE occurrences remain distinct.\n+\n+This is readiness for a clean committed candidate and fresh gates, not package FINAL, Exposition Seal or PURIFIED. Whole B4, seven containers, six future claims, Chapter2 partial/null denominator and Goal ACTIVE remain unchanged. No canonical/Git mutation or compiler execution by reviewer. Requested Astra/medium; runtime not independently attested."},{"sha":"0295d22e81f66af36e49f9967d8ba03b256de855","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/integration-application-v1.json","status":"added","additions":46,"deletions":0,"changes":46,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fintegration-application-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fintegration-application-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fintegration-application-v1.json?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@\n+{\n+  \"UTC\": \"2026-10-11T08:59:03.289302+00:00\",\n+  \"reader_proposal\": {\n+    \"path\": \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/reader-proposal-v3/proposal-v3.json\",\n+    \"sha256\": \"417bee256fbabcc0862067fdf4c4bfdddf857b628dd06aa9b380ea5e9712ea96\",\n+    \"bytes\": 14760\n+  },\n+  \"preservation\": [\n+ 